        {"title": "Order backlog", "bullets": ["Backlog EUR 410M, record high", "Order intake EUR 160M in Q3", "Book-to-bill 1.13"], "talk": ["Orders on the books are at four hundred ten million euros, which is the highest we've ever had.", "We took in one hundred sixty million of new business this quarter, so book-to-bill is about one point one."]},
        {"title": "Full-year outlook", "bullets": ["Revenue guidance EUR 560-575M", "EBITDA margin 14-15%", "Dividend proposal in February"], "talk": ["We're narrowing guidance to five hundred sixty to five hundred seventy-five million euros for the year.", "Margin should land between fourteen and fifteen percent, and the board will propose the dividend in February."]},
        {"title": "Questions", "bullets": ["Erik Halvorsen, CFO", "investor.relations@halvorsen.no"], "talk": ["That's all from my side, so let's open it up for questions.", "If anything comes up later, investor relations will get back to you within the day."]},
